Package: gpt-automatic-retry
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: yebear1 <yebear05@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, wmctrl, xdotool, xclip, libnotify-bin
Recommends: wtype, wl-clipboard, ydotool
Description: Automatically resume an interrupted ChatGPT conversation
 GPT Automatic Retry watches for a ChatGPT desktop window, maintains a
 configurable countdown, and sends a user-defined continuation message when
 the timer expires. It includes a desktop GUI, CLI, and systemd user service.
